        "text": "Strella lists 25 MCP tools, including strella_analyze_question_guide, strella_analyze_transcripts, strella_create_project, strella_edit_project, strella_edit_quotas, strella_edit_share_link, strella_get_guide, strella_get_questionnaire, strella_list_highlight_reels, strella_list_participants, strella_list_quotas, and strella_list_recruitment_orders."
